WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.837
UKRAINIAN AIR FORCE SAYS ABOUT
100 RUSSIAN MISSILES HAVE BEEN

00:00:03.837 --> 00:00:07.941
FIRED AT CITIES ACROSS UKRAINE,
HITTING KYIV, KHARKIV, LVIV, AS

00:00:07.941 --> 00:00:10.543
WELL AS OTHERS.
OFFICIALS SAY THE COUNTRY IS

00:00:10.543 --> 00:00:13.980
BRACING FOR MORE ATTACKS.
AN AIR RAID ALERT CAN BE HEARD

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:16.716
THROUGHOUT UKRAINE.
THE COUNTRY'S FOREIGN MINISTER

00:00:16.716 --> 00:00:20.720
SAYS THIS IS MOSCOW'S ANSWER TO
THE ISSUE OF PEACE TALKS.

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:27.660
CNN'S SAM KILEY IS LIVE FOR US
IN ONE OF THE CITIES TARGETED.

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:30.763
NIC ROBERTSON IS IN THE
NEWLY-LIBERATED CITY OF

00:00:30.763 --> 00:00:32.165
KHERSON.
GOOD TO HAVE YOU BOTH WITH US.

00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:34.767
SAM, I WANT TO START WITH YOU.
ONE OF THE REGIONS THAT WAS

00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:37.871
STRUCK BY THIS BARRAGE OF
MISSILES.

00:00:37.871 --> 00:00:45.678
WHAT MORE CAN YOU TELL US?
&gt;&gt; LINDA, THE WIDESPREAD

00:00:45.678 --> 00:00:49.849
CAMPAIGN ACROSS THIS COUNTRY,
EXCUSE ME, IS SOMETHING CLOSE

00:00:49.849 --> 00:00:54.854
TO WHAT WE SAW, EXCUSE ME, BACK
IN OCTOBER.

00:00:54.854 --> 00:00:59.859
WHEN THE INFRASTRUCTURE IN THE
COUNTRY WAS HIT VERY, VERY HARD

00:00:59.859 --> 00:01:03.796
WITH ATTACKS AGAINST ELECTRICAL
POWER GENERATING AREAS IN

00:01:03.796 --> 00:01:05.665
PARTICULAR.
THAT SEEMS TO HAVE BEEN

00:01:05.665 --> 00:01:07.767
REPEATED, PARTICULARLY IN
KHARKIV.

00:01:07.767 --> 00:01:11.738
IN KYIV THOUGH, THE CAPITAL,
SOME RESIDENTIAL BUILDINGS HAVE

00:01:11.738 --> 00:01:14.941
BEEN HIT WITH AT LEAST ONE
PERSON REPORTED DEAD THERE.

00:01:14.941 --> 00:01:19.913
THERE'S ALSO BEEN REPORTS OF
EXPLOSIONS IN LVIV, IN MY

00:01:19.913 --> 00:01:23.783
CAELEB, SO THE FAR NORTH OF THE
COUNTRY TO THE FAR SOUTH, AND

00:01:23.783 --> 00:01:26.619
HERE IN THE MIDDLE OF THE
COUNTRY, WE'VE ALSO BEEN

00:01:26.619 --> 00:01:28.888
ATTACKED.
ACCORDING TO THE LOCAL

00:01:28.888 --> 00:01:32.759
AUTHORITIES, THEY BELIEVE MOST
OF THE MISSILES, WE'VE HEARD

00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:37.664
SOME VERY LOUD EXPLOSIONS, WE
ARE NOT SURE WHETHER THAT IS

00:01:37.664 --> 00:01:40.133
OUTGOING OR INCOMING.
HERE, THE ATMOSPHERE I HAVE TO

00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:45.705
SAY IS ONE OF CONSIDERABLE
DEFIANCE EFFECTIVELY, WITH THE

00:01:45.705 --> 00:01:50.009
POPULATION LARGELY IGNORING THE
DEMANDS FROM THEIR AUTHORITIES

00:01:50.009 --> 00:01:52.178
THAT THEY TAKE COVER IN
SHELTERS.

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:58.618
BUT THAT ADVICE HAS GONE OUT
FROM THE GOVERNOR IN MYKOLAIV,

00:01:58.618 --> 00:02:00.954
RIGHT THROUGH TO THE GOVERNOR
IN KHARKIV, AND ELSEWHERE IN

00:02:00.954 --> 00:02:02.922
THE COUNTRY.
AS FAR AS THE AUTHORITIES ARE

00:02:02.922 --> 00:02:06.759
CONCERNED, THIS HAS BEEN
PERHAPS THE WORST OR SECOND

00:02:06.759 --> 00:02:12.665
WORST SALVO AND ATTEMPT TO
BREAK THE BACK OF THE POWER

00:02:12.665 --> 00:02:15.735
GENERATING, THE ENERGY
INFRASTRUCTURE OF THIS COUNTRY,

00:02:15.735 --> 00:02:20.206
WHICH AS WINTER IS NOW SITTING
IN, OF COURSE AFFECTS NOT ONLY

00:02:20.206 --> 00:02:22.809
THE POWER SUPPLY BUT THE WATER
SUPPLY, AND OF COURSE

00:02:22.809 --> 00:02:25.778
ULTIMATELY HEATING.
PARTICULARLY IN CITIES LIKE

00:02:25.778 --> 00:02:28.815
KHERSON WHERE THEY HAVE ALREADY
BEEN VERY BADLY HAMMERED AND

00:02:28.815 --> 00:02:31.818
ARE STRUGGLING TO GET THEIR
POWER SUPPLIES BACK UP IN ANY

00:02:31.818 --> 00:02:37.657
WAY AT ALL, LINDA.
&gt;&gt; I WANT TO GO TO OUR NICK

00:02:37.657 --> 00:02:42.128
ROBERTSON, WHO'S IN KHERSON,
NEWLY-LIBERATED CITY.

00:02:42.128 --> 00:02:44.764
AS SAM WAS SAYING, A CITY
ALREADY DEALING WITH POWER

00:02:44.764 --> 00:02:48.801
OUTAGES.
NOW THERE'S BARRAGE OF MISSILE

00:02:48.801 --> 00:02:50.903
STRIKES HITTING NOT ONLY
RESIDENTIAL BUILDINGS BUT

00:02:50.903 --> 00:02:54.607
INFRASTRUCTURE.
WHAT MORE ARE YOU LEARNING

00:02:54.607 --> 00:02:55.675
ABOUT THE NUMBER OF STRIKES,
NIC?

00:02:55.675 --> 00:03:00.813
&gt;&gt; WELL, 100 IS THE FIGURE
GIVEN BY UKRAINIAN AIR FORCE.

00:03:00.813 --> 00:03:04.917
THE IMPACT IS AN INCREASED
NUMBER OF BLACKOUTS.

00:03:04.917 --> 00:03:08.721
AN INCREASED CALL BY OFFICIALS
TO PEOPLE TO CONSERVE POWER, TO

00:03:08.721 --> 00:03:11.758
USE IT SPARINGLY.
WE UNDERSTAND THAT ABOUT ONE

00:03:11.758 --> 00:03:14.126
THIRD OF THE COUNTRY'S INTERNET
IS DOWN AT THE MOMENT.

00:03:14.126 --> 00:03:19.732
WE HAVE SEEN THIS ALREADY OVER
THE PAST MONTH OR SO SINCE THAT

00:03:19.732 --> 00:03:23.036
10TH OF OCTOBER, BEGINNING OF
83 MISSILE STRIKES ON UKRAINE'S

00:03:23.036 --> 00:03:26.906
POWER INFRASTRUCTURE.
WHAT RUSSIA HAS DONE IS DEGRADE

00:03:26.906 --> 00:03:33.646
IT TO A POINT WHERE THEY ARE AT
ABOUT 40% OF THE POWER

00:03:33.646 --> 00:03:37.950
GENERATING CAPACITY WAS DOWN
ACCORDING TO THE GOVERNMENT FEW

00:03:37.950 --> 00:03:39.952
WEEKS AGO.
THE GOVERNMENT VOWED TO GET IT

00:03:39.952 --> 00:03:42.689
BACK UP, AND IT APPEARS THE
RUSSIANS WERE USING THAT IS

00:03:42.689 --> 00:03:44.424
POLITICAL LEVERAGE IN ESSENCE
TO SAY, LOOK.

00:03:44.424 --> 00:03:47.093
WE HAVE DEGRADED IT TO THIS
POINT.

00:03:47.093 --> 00:03:50.830
IF WE JUST PRESS A LITTLE BIT
HARDER, YOU NOW KNOW WHAT WE

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:53.899
CAN TARGET AND WHAT WE CAN DO.
WE CAN MAKE IT MUCH WORSE.

00:03:53.899 --> 00:03:57.970
THEY BOUGHT INTO THE SITUATION
WHERE THE COUNTRY WAS HAVING

00:03:57.970 --> 00:04:00.673
THESE CONTROLLED BLACKOUTS
WHERE IT WASN'T JUST THE POWER

00:04:00.673 --> 00:04:04.811
GENERATING FACILITIES THAT HAD
BEEN HIT, BUT QUITE OFTEN THE

00:04:04.811 --> 00:04:09.782
SWITCHING FACILITIES.
THE FACILITIES WHERE THE

00:04:09.782 --> 00:04:12.719
INTELLIGENT CONNECTIONS IN THE
NETWORK, IF YOU WILL, THE

00:04:12.719 --> 00:04:15.922
INTERSECTIONS OF THE POWER
HIGHWAY THAT DETECT AND MONITOR

00:04:15.922 --> 00:04:19.125
HOW MUCH POWER THERE IS IN EACH
REGION.

00:04:19.125 --> 00:04:21.761
THEN BALANCING THE SYSTEM SO IT
CAN BE SWITCHED AROUND THE

00:04:21.761 --> 00:04:23.730
COUNTRY.
THAT IS WHAT HAS BEEN TAKEN

00:04:23.730 --> 00:04:25.832
OUT.
SO IN MANY WAYS, THE GOVERNMENT

00:04:25.832 --> 00:04:28.768
OFFICIALS HAVE DESCRIBED WHAT
THEY ARE DOING AT THE MOMENT AS

00:04:28.768 --> 00:04:31.937
TRYING TO SWITCH THE AVAILABLE
POWER THEY HAVE, SORT OF ON THE

00:04:31.937 --> 00:04:34.907
BACK ROADS IF YOU WILL, AROUND
THE COUNTRY, ALONG THE SORT OF

00:04:34.907 --> 00:04:38.878
ALTERNATE POWER LINES.
RUSSIA HAS BEEN VERY CAREFUL IN

00:04:38.878 --> 00:04:41.914
PARTICULAR IN THE WAY THEY HAVE
GONE ABOUT THIS.

00:04:41.914 --> 00:04:47.653
SO THE ATTACK TODAY IS AS MUCH
A POLITICAL STATEMENT AS IT IS

00:04:47.653 --> 00:04:52.892
A MILITARY, STRATEGIC, POWER
INFRASTRUCTURE STATEMENT AS

00:04:52.892 --> 00:04:54.794
WELL.
THAT IS HOW IT WILL BE READ IN

00:04:54.794 --> 00:04:57.029
KYIV.
THE REALITY IS THE GOVERNMENT

00:04:57.029 --> 00:05:00.800
KNOWS IT'S GOT A VERY LONG WAY
TO GO TO REPAIR THE POWER GRID.

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:06.639
THE DESTRUCTION THE RUSSIANS
BROUGHT DOWN HERE IN KHERSON

00:05:06.639 --> 00:05:08.174
TODAY HAS BEEN DESCRIBED AS
COMPLETE DESTRUCTION OF POWER,

00:05:08.174 --> 00:05:12.812
BECAUSE THEY WERE AT THE POWER
STATION AND BLEW UP THE TWO 250

00:05:12.812 --> 00:05:16.849
TON GENERATORS.
THEY SHOT UP THE OTHER

00:05:16.849 --> 00:05:20.987
SWITCHING EQUIPMENT.
THIS MEANS KHERSON WILL NOT BE

00:05:20.987 --> 00:05:22.422
COMING BACK ONLINE ANYTIME
SOON.

00:05:22.422 --> 00:05:24.490
IT'S EFFECTIVELY DESTROYED
ACCORDING TO OFFICIALS.

00:05:24.490 --> 00:05:28.928
RUSSIA IS HITTING A WEAK POINT
IN THE COUNTRY'S SYSTEM THAT

00:05:28.928 --> 00:05:32.198
KEEPS THE COUNTRY OPERATING,
THAT KEEPS BUSINESSES RUNNING,

00:05:32.198 --> 00:05:36.769
THAT KEEPS THE HEATING ON.
IT ALSO HASN'T SO FAR DAMAGED

00:05:36.769 --> 00:05:38.171
THE RESOLVE.
IN FACT, THE OPPOSITE.

00:05:38.171 --> 00:05:40.940
EVERY TIME THERE'S A BIG
BARRAGE OF STRIKES LIKE THIS,

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:45.044
PEOPLE DIP INTO THEIR POCKETS
HERE AND GIVE MORE MONEY TO THE

00:05:45.044 --> 00:05:46.312
MILITARY TO SUPPORT THEM AND TO
FRONTLINE.

00:05:46.312 --> 00:05:50.983
&gt;&gt; EVERYONE IN UKRAINE WANTING
AN END TO THIS WAR.

00:05:50.983 --> 00:05:53.352
NIC ROBERTSON FOR US IN
KHERSON.

00:05:53.352 --> 00:05:58.024
SAM KILEY IN KRYVYI RIH.
GOOD TO HAVE YOU BOTH WITH US.

00:05:58.024 --> 00:06:02.762
THANKS VERY MUCH.
THE WAR IN UKRAINE HAS CAST A

00:06:02.762 --> 00:06:03.963
DARK CLOUD OVER THIS YEAR'S G20
SUMMIT.

00:06:03.963 --> 00:06:06.499
MUCH OF THE DISCUSSION HAS BEEN
ON HOW TO END IT.

00:06:06.499 --> 00:06:10.636
UKRAINIAN PRESIDENT VOLODYMYR
ZELENSKYY SAYS HE HAS THE PATH

00:06:10.636 --> 00:06:13.506
TO PEACE IN TEN STEPS.
HE PRESENTED THOSE STEPS

00:06:13.506 --> 00:06:18.444
EARLIER IN A TAPED ADDRESS.
STEPS INCLUDE FOOD SECURITY AND

00:06:18.444 --> 00:06:20.713
NUCLEAR SAFETY AS WELL AS A
PEACE TREATY WITH RUSSIA.

00:06:20.713 --> 00:06:22.147
HE SAYS THE TIME TO END THE WAR
IS NOW.

00:06:22.147 --> 00:06:30.389
&gt;&gt; WE WILL NOT ALLOW RUSSIA TO
WAIT IT OUT, BUILD UP ITS

00:06:30.389 --> 00:06:34.327
FORCES, AND THEN START A NEW
SERIES OF TERROR AND GLOBAL

00:06:34.327 --> 00:06:36.462
DESTABILIZE A SHUNT.
I AM CONVINCED NOW IS THE TIME

00:06:36.462 --> 00:06:38.264
WHEN THE RUSSIAN DESTRUCTIVE
WAR MUST AND CAN BE STOPPED.

00:06:38.264 --> 00:06:43.836
&gt;&gt; U.S. PRESIDENT JOE BIDEN IS
TRYING TO GET MEMBER COUNTRIES

00:06:43.836 --> 00:06:47.974
TO SPEAK WITH A UNITED VOICE IN
CONDEMNING RUSSIA'S AGGRESSION.

00:06:47.974 --> 00:06:51.978
THAT IS OPPOSED TO THE COURT
FRAGMENTED APPROACH.

00:06:51.978 --> 00:06:54.680
THE PRESIDENT OF INDONESIA,
WHICH IS HOSTING THE SUMMIT IN

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:56.849
BALI, SAYS A PROLONGED WAR WILL
HAVE IMPLICATIONS FOR YEARS TO

00:06:56.849 --> 00:07:04.123
COME.
&gt;&gt; AND THE WAR.

00:07:04.123 --> 00:07:10.029
IT WILL BE DIFFICULT FOR THE
WORLD TO MOVE FORWARD.

00:07:10.029 --> 00:07:17.136
IF THE WAR DOES NOT END, IT
WILL BE DIFFICULT FOR US TO

00:07:17.136 --> 00:07:26.345
TAKE RESPONSIBILITY FOR THE
FUTURE AND FUTURE GENERATIONS.

00:07:26.345 --> 00:07:30.016
&gt;&gt; FOR ITS PART, RUSSIA BLAMES
THE WEST FOR THE WAR IN

00:07:30.016 --> 00:07:33.252
UKRAINE.
AT THE G20 EARLIER, FOREIGN

00:07:33.252 --> 00:07:35.821
MINISTER SERGEI LAVROV DEFENDED
MOSCOW'S ACTIONS.

00:07:35.821 --> 00:07:45.097
&gt;&gt; MORE OFTEN THEY TALK ABOUT
UNPROVOKED AGGRESSION.

00:07:45.097 --> 00:07:49.435
THE MORE EVERYBODY IS CONVINCED
THAT THIS AGGRESSION WAS

00:07:49.435 --> 00:07:53.406
PROVOKED BY THEM.
AND IT IS NOT IN AGGRESSION BUT

00:07:53.406 --> 00:08:00.212
IN OPERATION TO DEFEND THE
LEGITIMATE INTERESTS OF RUSSIAN

00:08:00.212 --> 00:08:07.219
SECURITY BECAUSE OF THREATS ON
RUSSIAN BORDERS, AND TO DEFEND

00:08:07.219 --> 00:08:08.354
THE RUSSIAN POPULATION OF
DONBAS.

00:08:08.354 --> 00:08:14.427
&gt;&gt; LAVROV ALSO CLAIMS NATO AND
THE EUROPEAN UNION HAVE BEEN

00:08:14.427 --> 00:08:16.629
PARTICIPANTS IN WHAT HE CALLS A
HYBRID WAR IN UKRAINE BY

00:08:16.629 --> 00:08:20.433
TRAINING TROOPS AND HELPING
WITH INTELLIGENCE AND

00:08:20.433 --> 00:08:23.402
TARGETING.
OUR CHAIN LEE IS STANDING BY AT

00:08:23.402 --> 00:08:25.771
THE SUMMIT IN BALI.
GOOD TO HAVE YOU WITH US, MJ.

00:08:25.771 --> 00:08:28.774
THIS IS DAY ONE OF THIS G20
SUMMIT.

00:08:28.774 --> 00:08:34.280
WHAT EXACTLY DOES PRESIDENT
BIDEN HOPE TO GAIN FROM THIS

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:36.715
SUMMIT?
&gt;&gt; YOU KNOW, AS PRESIDENT BIDEN

00:08:36.715 --> 00:08:41.420
AND HIS FELLOW FOREIGN LEADERS
KICKED OFF THE G20 SUMMIT,

00:08:41.420 --> 00:08:43.623
THERE'S NO QUESTION THAT THERE
WASN'T A SINGLE ISSUE THAT

00:08:43.623 --> 00:08:48.394
LOOMED LARGER OVER THE SUMMIT
THEN THE ONGOING WAR IN

00:08:48.394 --> 00:08:50.529
UKRAINE.
BOTH IN TERMS OF THE

00:08:50.529 --> 00:08:54.367
DESTRUCTION WITHIN UKRAINE AS
WELL AS THE GLOBAL ECONOMIC AND

00:08:54.367 --> 00:08:58.304
HUMANITARIAN IMPACT THAT THE
WAR HAS HAD THROUGHOUT THE YEAR.

00:08:58.304 --> 00:09:02.308
I CAN TELL YOU SENIOR U.S.
OFFICIALS HEADING INTO TODAY

00:09:02.308 --> 00:09:07.480
HAVE SAID THAT MOST G20 MEMBERS
CONDEMN THE WAR IN UKRAINE.

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:11.350
THERE WAS SORT OF A RECOGNITION
THERE THAT THERE ARE A HANDFUL

00:09:11.350 --> 00:09:15.554
OF COUNTRIES, G20 MEMBERS, THAT
HAVE NOT ALWAYS SORT OF FULLY

00:09:15.554 --> 00:09:19.291
AND OPENLY CONDEMNED THIS WAR.
WE ARE OF COURSE TALKING ABOUT

00:09:19.291 --> 00:09:23.429
COUNTRIES LIKE CHINA, LIKE
INDIA, SAUDI ARABIA, AND EVEN

00:09:23.429 --> 00:09:26.799
THE HOST COUNTRY TO SOME EXTENT,
INDONESIA.

00:09:26.799 --> 00:09:31.337
SO ALL OF THIS HAS SORT OF BEEN
A COMPLICATING DYNAMIC, BUT

00:09:31.337 --> 00:09:35.541
MOST G20 LEADERS AND MEMBER
COUNTRIES DID ULTIMATELY END UP

00:09:35.541 --> 00:09:38.411
SIGNING A DECLARATION
CONDEMNING THE WAR.

00:09:38.411 --> 00:09:42.515
OBVIOUSLY, THIS WAS SIGNIFICANT
FOR PRESIDENT BIDEN GIVEN THAT

00:09:42.515 --> 00:09:46.485
THE U.S. IS OVERARCHING GOAL,
COMING TO THE G20 SUMMIT, WAS

00:09:46.485 --> 00:09:50.623
REALLY TO SORT OF ELEVATE THE
COLLECTIVE AND GLOBAL VOICE

00:09:50.623 --> 00:09:52.792
CONDEMNING THIS ONGOING WAR.

